<view class="page">
  <view class="card">
    <text class="card-title">工资参数</text>

    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-label">姓名</text>
      <input class="txt-in" value="{{owner}}" placeholder="可不填" maxlength="12" bindblur="setOwner" />
    </view>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="col">
        <text class="row-label">基本工资（元/月）</text>
        <text class="sub">按法定工作日折算成日薪</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{enableBase}}" data-key="enableBase" bindchange="toggle" color="#1B5E9B" />
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-label">金额</text>
      <input class="num-in" type="digit" value="{{baseSalary}}" bindblur="setSalary" />
    </view>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="col">
        <text class="row-label">课时费（元/节）</text>
        <text class="sub">按当月实际课时计</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{enableLesson}}" data-key="enableLesson" bindchange="toggle" color="#1B5E9B" />
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-label">单价</text>
      <input class="num-in" type="digit" value="{{rate}}" bindblur="setRate" />
    </view>

    <view class="rate-row" wx:for="{{rates}}" wx:key="id">
      <input class="txt-in rate-name-in" value="{{item.name}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindblur="setRateName"
        maxlength="8" placeholder="档位名，如晚自习" />
      <input class="num-in" type="digit" value="{{item.price}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindblur="setRatePrice" />
      <view class="rate-x" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="delRate">✕</view>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="sub rate-hint">晚自习、代课单价不一样就加一档；记账时选了哪档按哪档算</text>
      <view class="btn sm" bindtap="addRate">＋ 加档</view>
    </view>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="col">
        <text class="row-label">晚修监考</text>
        <text class="sub">一晚就一场，2 小时 10 元，定死的；不算课时也不占出勤半天，不按小时乘钱</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-label">每次时长（小时）</text>
      <input class="num-in" type="digit" value="{{nightHours}}" bindblur="setNightHours" />
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-label">每次金额（元）</text>
      <input class="num-in" type="digit" value="{{nightFee}}" bindblur="setNightFee" />
    </view>

    <view class="row">
      <text class="sub rate-hint">学校口径变了才改这两项，平时不用动；时长只写进核对单，金额才参与算钱。金额填 0 就不显示晚修录入（学校不发这笔钱时用）；已记过的日子仍能打开清零，已记账的月份仍按原价。白天照常记出勤，晚上这场只点 1 次；同一场别再勾「加班」半天，会重复算钱。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="col">
        <text class="row-label">监考计入出勤</text>
        <text class="sub">半天监考折 0.5 天，与上班同价</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{enableInv}}" data-key="enableInv" bindchange="toggle" color="#1B5E9B" />
    </view>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="col">
        <text class="row-label">加班计入出勤</text>
        <text class="sub">含休息日加班，不限应上班天数上限</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{enableOt}}" data-key="enableOt" bindchange="toggle" color="#1B5E9B" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="card-title">出勤规则</text>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="col">
        <text class="row-label">法定工作日默认算上班</text>
        <text class="sub">打开后，没填的日子自动按上班计，10 月只需补监考和课时</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{autoWork}}" data-key="autoWork" bindchange="toggle" color="#1B5E9B" />
    </view>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="col">
        <text class="row-label">按课程表自动记课时</text>
        <text class="sub">本月已过去、有课又没填过的日子自动记上；未来不预填，已核对的月份不动。自动填完 10 秒可撤销，撤销后本月不再自动填；关掉开关后已记的账不删。</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{autoLessons}}" data-key="autoLessons" bindchange="toggle" color="#1B5E9B" />
    </view>

    <view class="week-block">
      <text class="row-label">常规一周</text>
      <text class="sub">法定节假日与调休优先，这里只在普通日子生效。点格子切换：班 → 半 → 休</text>
      <view class="week">
        <view class="wd {{item.on ? 'on' : (item.half ? 'half' : '')}}" wx:for="{{weekPattern}}" wx:key="i"
              data-i="{{item.i}}" bindtap="cycleWeek">
          <text class="wd-l">{{item.label}}</text>
          <text class="wd-v">{{item.txt}}</text>
        </view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="row">
      <view class="col">
        <text class="row-label">入职起算日</text>
        <text class="sub">{{startDateText}}</text>
      </view>
      <picker mode="date" value="{{startDate}}" bindchange="pickStart">
        <view class="pick-btn">{{startDate ? '改' : '选'}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="param-note" wx:if="{{startDate}}" bindtap="clearStart">清除起算日</view>

    <view class="row" bindtap="gotoHoliday">
      <view class="col">
        <text class="row-label">放假安排</text>
        <text class="sub">{{holidayText}}</text>
      </view>
      <text class="arrow">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="card-title">课程表与教学周</text>
    <view class="row" bindtap="gotoCourses">
      <view class="col">
        <text class="row-label">课程表</text>
        <text class="sub">第 1 教学周：{{termStart}} · 共 {{courseCount}} 门课</text>
      </view>
      <text class="arrow">›</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="card-title">口令锁</text>
    <view class="row">
      <view class="col">
        <text class="row-label">打开时验证口令</text>
        <text class="sub">{{lockOn ? '已开启：冷启动和切后台超过 5 分钟都要重输' : '未开启：拿到手机的人能直接看到记录'}}</text>
      </view>
      <switch checked="{{lockOn}}" bindchange="toggleLock" color="#1B5E9B" />
    </view>
    <view class="row" wx:if="{{lockOn}}" bindtap="changePass">
      <text class="row-label">修改口令</text>
      <text class="arrow">›</text>
    </view>
    <view class="data-tips">
      <text>口令只在本机校验，忘记无法找回。记录本身仍是明文存在微信里，这道锁挡的是随手翻看；真正的加密靠手机自己的锁屏。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <text class="card-title">数据</text>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-label">本机记录</text>
      <text class="row-value">{{dayCount}} 天</text>
    </view>
    <view class="row">
      <text class="row-label">存放位置</text>
      <text class="row-value">本机微信存储</text>
    </view>
    <view class="data-tips">
      <text>小程序的数据存在这台设备上，不上传服务器。换设备或换人用，靠下面的导出 / 导入搬一次；电脑端也可以直接用 HTML 版，两边 JSON 格式相同。</text>
    </view>
    <view class="data-actions">
      <view class="btn primary" bindtap="exportBackup">导出备份 JSON</view>
      <view class="btn" bindtap="importBackup">从聊天导入</view>
    </view>
    <view class="btn danger full" bindtap="clearAll">清空全部数据</view>
  </view>

  <view class="tips">
    <text>导出的 JSON 可以发给「文件传输助手」，在电脑上打开、或用 HTML 版导入。手机端导出会生成文件并转为发送给聊天；电脑端会直接弹出保存位置。</text>
  </view>
</view>
